      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1243,
      "text": "How [can there be a treaty] – if they were to overcome you, they would neither respect ties of kinship nor treaty[12]? They please you with their tongues, while their hearts are averse to it, and most of them are wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tawba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Repentance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 129,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 188,
      "ruku": 157,
      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1244,
      "text": "They have sold the verses of Allah for a small price and prevented [people] from His way[13]. Terrible is indeed what they have done!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tawba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Repentance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 129,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 188,
      "ruku": 157,
      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1245,
      "text": "They do not honor the ties of kinship or treaties with regard to the believers. It is they who are the transgressors.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tawba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Repentance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 129,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 188,
      "ruku": 157,
      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1246,
      "text": "Yet if they repent, establish prayer and give zakah, then they are your brothers in faith. We explain the verses in detail for people who know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tawba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Repentance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 129,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 188,
      "ruku": 157,
      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1247,
      "text": "But if they break their oaths after making a pledge and revile your religion, then fight the leaders of disbelief – whose oaths mean nothing to them – so that they may desist.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tawba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Repentance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 129,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 188,
      "ruku": 157,
      "hizbQuarter": 75,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1248,
      "text": "Will you not fight people who broke their oaths, conspired to expel the Messenger[14], and initiated the war against you first[15]? Do you fear them? Rather it is Allah Whom you should fear, if you are [truly] believers.",
      "surah": {
